{"2729830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pumpkin Woods", "steam_appid": 2729830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Woods is a witch-themed open world survival crafting sandbox set in a strange and unforgiving forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather magical resources, brew potions, trade with merchants, roam around in your traveler wagon, explore mysterious landmarks and manage your health, happiness, hunger, and thirst to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.webm?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.mp4?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❗ IMPORTANT ❗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ Mouse &amp; keyboard only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️ Designed for 16:9 resolutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 No handholding. Explore, experiment, and figure things out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚰️ You will die... but each attempt makes you wiser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 Secrets are everywhere, if you know where to look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.webm?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.mp4?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your witch attire, furnish a secluded cabin, adopt a companion cat or unicorn, and travel by foot or enchanted broom through a world shaped by dynamic weather and procedural generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill mode is available for players who want a more relaxed pace.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.webm?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.mp4?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Woods is a witch-themed open world survival crafting sandbox set in a strange and unforgiving forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather magical resources, brew potions, trade with merchants, roam around in your traveler wagon, explore mysterious landmarks and manage your health, happiness, hunger, and thirst to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.webm?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.mp4?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❗ IMPORTANT ❗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ Mouse &amp; keyboard only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️ Designed for 16:9 resolutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 No handholding. Explore, experiment, and figure things out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚰️ You will die... but each attempt makes you wiser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 Secrets are everywhere, if you know where to look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.webm?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.mp4?t=1788222905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your witch attire, furnish a secluded cabin, adopt a companion cat or unicorn, and travel by foot or enchanted broom through a world shaped by dynamic weather and procedural generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill mode is available for players who want a more relaxed pace.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.poster.avif?t=1788222905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store